WEBVTT

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:16.500
<v Amara Okafor>I think it should be scrapped.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:22.000
<v Amara Okafor>In the pilot districts, reading scores
for the youngest pupils are down by about 12 per cent,

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:26.000
<v Amara Okafor>and that's on top of the gap we already had.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.000
<v Nils Lindqvist>I disagree that it should be scrapped.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:49.500
<v Nils Lindqvist>I accept the reading figures for the youngest pupils.
But maths scores are flat, attendance is up,

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.000
<v Nils Lindqvist>and teacher vacancies in those districts have halved.
